  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 74a5517cb3b26436aa548a9074267851, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "T\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p ho\xE0n to\xE0n mechanic \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc:
    ch\u1ECDn th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1 hai bi, gi\u1EEF ti\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED9 v\xE0 chuy\u1EC3n
    m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EE1; kh\xF4ng th\xEAm l\u1EF1c, ch\u1EA5t l\u1ECFng ho\u1EB7c
    \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n m\u1EDBi. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P18/P19/P21/P22/P23 \u2014
    hai bi, ba ch\u1EB7ng kh\xF4: ph\u1ED1i h\u1EE3p \u0111\xF2n b\u1EA9y, l\u01B0u
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng b\u1EB1ng cam, chuy\u1EC3n l\u1ED3ng r\u1ED3i \u0111\xF3n
    v\u1EC1 s\xE2n cu\u1ED1i.\nRecovery: T\u1EEBng ch\u1EB7ng c\xF3 s\xE2n ch\u1EE9a
    hai bi v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng thu h\u1ED3i ri\xEAng; ch\u1ED1t gi\u1EEF ph\u1EA7n
    \u0111\xE3 xong; c\xFA \u0111\xF3n cu\u1ED1i kh\xF4ng x\xF3a chu\u1ED7i c\u01A1
    kh\xED; c\u1EA3 hai ph\u1EA3i tho\xE1t th\u1EADt"
